  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mozambique Tourism Institutional Capacity Strengthening</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this activity is to harmonize functions of the Tourism Institutions of Mozambique which includes interventions in policy vision and strategy, tourism budgeting, licensing, marketing, training and statistics at the National, Provincial and District levels. The purpose of this grant is to strengthen the tourism planning, management, and statistics collection capacity of MITUR (Ministry of Tourism) and its provincial tourism departments (DPTUR), with an emphasis on the three pilot provinces of Maputo, Inhambane, and Nampula.</narrative>
  </description>
